          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "సూచించు — sūciñcu — \"to suggest; to indicate\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "మా ఉపాధ్యాయుడు ఒక కొత్త పుస్తకం సూచించాడు. mā upādhyāyuḍu oka kotta pustakaṁ sūciñcāḍu. Our teacher suggested a new book."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): సూచించాను, sūciñcānu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The verb of సూచన, a suggestion, which you know."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "సూచించు (sūciñcu) is built on Sanskrit sūcana, \"pointing out, indicating; an indication\" (Monier-Williams), with the Telugu verb ending -ఇంచు."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
